      "writtenOn": "2020-01-06T13:45:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I notice now that solution #2 above mentioned equals() when it should instead have mentioned satisfiedBy(). For a StringNetworkSpecifier, the two are currently the same. Is it enough to modify only satisfiedBy? Modifying equals() is pretty hacky.",
      "parentUuid": "153d2789_34b4e8a9",
